4	 * A pinned Meridian tab is persistent, so launches open beside it. An
5	 * unpinned Meridian page is a disposable New Tab instance, so it navigates in
6	 * place. If Chrome cannot identify the current tab, opening a new tab is the
7	 * safest fallback.
